00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:39,750
During the summer of 1981, a group of friends in New York are
completely unprepared for the onslaught of AIDS.

4
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:51,000
What starts as a rumor about a mysterious "gay cancer" soon turns into a major crisis as, one by one,
some of the friends begin to fall ill, leaving the others to panic about who will be next.

5
00:30:56,250 --> 00:31:02,250
As death takes its toll, the lives of these friends are forever redefined
by an unconditional display of love, hope and courage.

